 dependencies and compatibility ranges for packaging-friendly builds\r\n- Update README with packaging status and CI notes\r\n\r\nThis release is mainly a maintenance and packaging-focused update.\r\nIt does not introduce a large new end-user feature set, but it improves project structure and prepares `hwatch` for smoother distribution packaging on Debian- and Fedora-based systems.\r\n","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
